{"id":"2485b90ec527f97e","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-dce-real.md","title":"D.c.e. Reals","display":"df-dce-real — D.c.e. Reals","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-dce-real","aliases":["43-df-dce-real"],"display":"df-dce-real — D.c.e. Reals","depends_on":["[[43-df-leftcomputable]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definition 8.5.1","source_printed_pages":"152","source_pdf_pages":"172","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-dce-real"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-dce-real</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dce-real — D.c.e. Reals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 8.5.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"152"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"172"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}:\\mathbb R\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}:\\mathbb R\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a>。本节引入谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DCEReal}\">\\(\\mathrm{DCEReal}\\)</span> 及集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\iff\\exists y,z\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(y)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(z)\\land x=y-z\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\iff\\exists y,z\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(y)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(z)\\land x=y-z\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R:\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal D\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R:\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里的 d.c.e. 修饰实数值，不能与“其二进制数字集是两个 c.e. 集之差”混为同一定义。实数差分允许正值、负值与零；后续有界变差刻画解释它的有效近似含义。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Definition 8.5.1；印刷页 152，PDF 页 172。本轮核对范围及证明限制如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}:\\mathbb R\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 采用 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]。本节引入谓词 $\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 及集合 $\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathbb R$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}:\\mathbb R\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DCEReal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\iff\\exists y,z\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(y)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(z)\\land x=y-z\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R:\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1385,"backlinks":[{"id":"614b71d8502e7bb4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in[0,1]$；$\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}$ 与 $\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 见 [[43-df-ktrivial-real]]、[[43-df-dce-real]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-dce-real]] — D.c.e. Reals"},{"id":"87a029d02ac0983e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-dce-real]]，$\\operatorname{BVApprox}$ 采用 [[43-df-bounded-variation-approximation]]。"},{"id":"192242ff132fc1ff","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-dce-real]]。倒数项的变量 $z$ 仅在 $\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\}$ 上量化。"},{"id":"af397ba861d72428","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\in[0,1]$；$\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-dce-real]]，$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\mathrm{RightComputable}$ 采用 [[43-df-effective-real-cut]]，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 采用 [[43-df-mlrandom]] 并作用于序列 $X$。"},{"id":"4c3fe677631170c2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$a:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathbb R$，$a(n)\\ne0$，$r\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-dce-real]]。"}],"outgoing":["e7d00f16a112ff92"]}